  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are the first three terms of an arithmetic progression,&nbsp;then its sum upto <math><mn>20</mn></math> terms is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>90</mn></math> or <math><mn>175</mn></math>",
